# I-Guard provider-side validation.
#
# DownloadProvider runs in the mediaprovider domain on this AOSP build, while
# the modular MediaProvider process runs in mediaprovider_app. Allow only those
# provider domains to publish I-Guard entry context to the kernel control device
# before opening the delegated file object.
allow { mediaprovider mediaprovider_app } iguard_ctl_device:chr_file { getattr open write };
